{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"removal_events is the removal ledger beyond removed_at: every removal of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this node and every undo that cancelled one, except removed_at itself."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"An actor’s events alternate in ticket order, a removal then the undo"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cancelling it, so each is told apart by its place. Empty when removed_at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"says it all. A piece recreated after GC records a stand-in removal by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"undoing actor at lamport 0, then its cancel. The pairing relies on an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"undo cancelling only its own actor’s removal; a change to that rule needs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a new field, not a new reading of this one."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_TextNode\/removalEvents","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_TextNode"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"removalEvents"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie0A14_V1_TimeTicketV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_TimeTicket","text":"Yorkie_V1_TimeTicket"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"removalEvents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Yorkie_V1_TimeTicket","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie0A14_V1_TimeTicketV","kind":"typeId